  <h1>UPS Recycling in Kochi</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    UPS units — the battery-backed power supplies protecting computers, servers, network cabinets and home electronics from power fluctuations — retire on a steady cycle because internal batteries wear out every 3-5 years. This page covers what UPS types get accepted, why battery separation matters, and how bulk UPS retirement (server rooms, offices with battery banks) is planned.
  </p>

